[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11580.79, "timestamp": "03:13:00", "text": "ロッドの隆起はまさに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11583.429, "timestamp": "03:13:03", "text": "プロペラはそこにある。だから毎回"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11584.79, "timestamp": "03:13:04", "text": "プロペラが上がってきても、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11587.64, "timestamp": "03:13:07", "text": "カチッという音はするが、銃は発射されない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11589.11, "timestamp": "03:13:09", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11590.95, "timestamp": "03:13:10", "text": "そして、これは本当にあっという間に起こる。これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11593.51, "timestamp": "03:13:13", "text": "ほんの一瞬のうちに。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11596.59, "timestamp": "03:13:16", "text": "あなたは自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11598.63, "timestamp": "03:13:18", "text": "プロペラ。一方、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11600.309, "timestamp": "03:13:20", "text": "プロペラが前に現れる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11608.71, "timestamp": "03:13:28", "text": "ああ、トリガーは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11611.67, "timestamp": "03:13:31", "text": "プロペラが停止した。ああ、ちょっと待って。えっと、なぜ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11614.389, "timestamp": "03:13:34", "text": "この翼にボタンを割り当てることはできませんか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11616.79, "timestamp": "03:13:36", "text": "スイープ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11619.67, "timestamp": "03:13:39", "text": "わかった。軸を編集します。アクセス権限の編集をクリックしてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11621.59, "timestamp": "03:13:41", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11623.75, "timestamp": "03:13:43", "text": "割り当てボタン。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11624.444, "timestamp": "03:13:44", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11631.429, "timestamp": "03:13:51", "text": "うん。選択する必要があると思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11635.99, "timestamp": "03:13:55", "text": "価値観。それは全体的な問題ではない。自動。"}]